<title>USA: Travis Emergency Dist 2, Texas, won by Rauscher.</title>
<headline>Travis Emergency Dist 2, Texas, won by Rauscher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rauscher Pierce said it won $2.150 million of Travis County Emergency Service District No. 2, Texas, limited tax bonds, series 1997 with a net interest cost of 5.541 percent.</p>
</text>
